  "details": "For some reason, when a user is in a station, pickups occasionally ignore their autohold setting, with it turning off for a small amount of time until they repeatedly pick it up enough.\n\nIt seems to happen more often on desktop than in VR, although that is most likely due to differences in how index controllers handle pickups.\n\nYou can find it happening in this world on the ship cannons and the handheld grapplehooks and weaponry: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_03415963-883e-4510-9051-d142aeac65a5",
